{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/066e9d2be8249d4386772b7c5acb7bbb.avif?t=1767989188\" width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summit Drive a game by Luke Kim</strong>\u00a0is a driving game where you play as an anthropomorphic bird who must make their way up to the mountain summit for a view like none other. It blends the mechanical absurdity of Enviro-bear 2000\u2019s controls with A Short Hike\u2019s cozy, quirky aesthetic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/e8243d19988d6e61e96a8b4c9a6626a4.poster.avif?t=1767989188\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/e8243d19988d6e61e96a8b4c9a6626a4.webm?t=1767989188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/e8243d19988d6e61e96a8b4c9a6626a4.mp4?t=1767989188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer a physics-based vehicle using only your mouse buttons for directional control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You must use your left mouse to interact, drive, and steer, while using your right mouse button to brake and change gears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/18b0417aae03d056847d7d7f3e7cc585.poster.avif?t=1767989188\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/18b0417aae03d056847d7d7f3e7cc585.webm?t=1767989188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/18b0417aae03d056847d7d7f3e7cc585.mp4?t=1767989188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path upwards is narrow, steep, bumpy, and filled with obstacles that appear before your eyes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game explores the fear of driving and falling, blending them into a metaphor for life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose all of your progress again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music is great! You will love the music...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road is right ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to drive up?</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Campfire Summit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871250/574d861f923a892203b5026cc68bb74902ca513e.jpg"},{"name":"Finally Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871250/fca2cc522fdbdb762fc497c0add79da6a9963759.jpg"},{"name":"Falling License","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871250/09412aea2542f72ce26a3944dc63c886bd66281e.jpg"},{"name":"Hear More Music","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871250/c040cf0fc0eb26b64632a97a70d14fbb6a7d9617.jpg"},{"name":"Bring Home A Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871250/6e3b450e32d3315da11583c0a044c56b7fa7ab6a.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Demon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871250/39f6e5c74098acec9bb0e25aeb9af1b08e144a38.jpg"},{"name":"Bird Flash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871250/5eac0510f9140a1801ea839edad1aac1ef0203eb.jpg"}]